    "title_en": "Quantum Separability in Polynomial Time",
    "abstract_en": "The quantum separability problem asks whether a bipartite density matrix is separable or is $η$-far from every separable state. We give a randomized polynomial-time algorithm for this problem for every fixed constant gap $η>0$, when distance is measured in the Euclidean norm.",
